menu "Pupu"

    config PUPU_TIME_SCALE
        int "Pet time scale (1 real minute = N pet minutes)"
        range 1 120
        default 1
        help
            Multiplies only pet time (decay, catch-up, pet days). Screen-off timers,
            save intervals, the mini-game, and the Bluetooth window always use real time.
            Use 1 for normal play. sdkconfig.dev-fast sets 60 for development builds.

endmenu
